termet.2020.106978","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"K. Santhy, K.C. Hari Kumar, Thermodynamic modelling of magnetic laves phase in Fe–Ti system using first principle method, Intermetallics 128, 106978 (2021)."},{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.calphad.2012.06.010","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"Cuiping Guo, Changrong Li, Xiang Zheng, Zhenmin Du, Thermodynamic modeling of the Fe–Ti–V system, Calphad 38, 155-160 (2012)."},{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1016/S1003-6326(11)61450-7","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"H. Bo, J. Wang, L. Duarte, C. Leinenbach, L. Liu, H. Liu, Z. Jin, Trans. Nonferrous Met. Soc. China, 22, 2204-11(2012)."},{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11669-024-01124-9","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"Zhi Liang, Ursula Kattner, Kamal Choudharry, Francesca Tavazza, Carelyn Campbell, Thermodynamic Assessments of Ti-Al, Ti-Fe, and Ti-Al-Fe Systems with Four-Sublattice Description of Ordered Body-Centered Cubic Phase and Density Functional Theory Data, J. Phase Equilib. Diffus. 45, 732-756 (2024)."},{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11669-021-00889-7","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"G. Zhang, W. Zheng, Z. Zhao, Y. He, Z. Zheng, D. Tang, J. Phase Equilib. Diffus., 42, 363-72(2021)."}],"isBasedOn":["https://doi.org/10.1361/105497198770341923","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2019.05.341","https://doi.org/10.1007/s11663-998-0113-z","https://doi.org/10.1016/0364-5916(94)90028-0","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matchemphys.2011.07.071","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.intermet.2020.106978","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.calphad.2012.06.010","https://doi.org/10.1016/S1003-6326(11)61450-7","https://doi.org/10.1007/s11669-024-01124-9","https://doi.org/10.1007/s11669-021-00889-7","https://github.com/orchid-calphad/orchid-project.org/blob/main/data/databases/sgte-binary/FeTi-09Key.tdb","https://github.com/orchid-calphad/orchid-project.org/blob/main/data/databases/sgte-binary/FeTi-11Wan.tdb","https://github.com/orchid-calphad/orchid-project.org/blob/main/data/databases/sg